  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together cumin, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Rub the spice mixture all over the chicken breast.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the quenched, tagine, and grain to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2-3 minutes, or until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Serve the grilled chicken with the tagine sauce spooned over the top.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley."
